" alt="v57 主机模型，正式产品素材待确认"><span class="asset-tag">当前模型预览 / 非最终 CMF 渲染</span></div><div><div class="eyebrow">DESKTOP CNC</div><h2>5-axis<br>CNC Machine</h2><p>先看完整设备，再深入理解加工空间与关键结构。正式性能与配置在核验后补充。</p><button class="primary" data-jump-banner>探索机器 <span>↗</span></button><button class="text-link" data-product="cnc:0" style="margin:15px 0 0 22px"><span>产品详情</span><span>↗</span></button></div></div><div class="filter-row" aria-label="产品目录筛选"><button class="filter" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="${routeFilter==='all'}">All products</button>${cats.map(c=>`<button class="filter" data-filter="${c.id}" aria-pressed="${routeFilter===c.id}">${c.name}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="catalog-grid" id="catalogGrid">${catalog()}</div><p class="catalog-note">名称和分类来自原稿。配套图为示意，不暗示具体 SKU、尺寸或适配关系。Materials 目录仅保留原稿 wood，与首页加工体验分开。</p></div></section>`;}
function softwarePage(){return routeHeader('Software','一个稳定的界面窗口，让用户看见操作、过程与结果之间的联系。')+`<section class="route-body"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE / INTERACTION STUDY</div><h2 class="section-title">Pamlx Studio</h2></div><p>原稿名称保留，正式拼写待核对。<br>下方为网页展示占位，不是已实现的软件功能。</p></div><div class="software-window"><div class="window-bar"><span>PAMLX STUDIO / UI PLACEHOLDER</span><span>界面素材待接入</span></div><div class="window-body"><div class="window-sidebar"><button class="current" data-software="0">任务概览</button><button data-software="1">查看过程</button><button data-software="2">结果预览</button></div><div class="window-canvas"><img id="softwareImage" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="界面参考占位，非正式 Pamlx Studio 软件界面"><span class="asset-tag" id="softwareCaption">01 / 操作界面参考 · 源自已有概念镜头</span></div><div class="window-result"><b id="softwareResult">任务与预览</b><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="现有概念镜头的结果位置"><p>仅示意界面与结果的关联。没有新增 AI、自动路径或一键加工能力。</p></div></div></div><div class="software-actions">${[['01','看清任务','集中展示与当前操作相关的信息，而不是塞满一张缩小的截图。'],['02','看懂过程','切换后突出相关区域，让操作与画面产生联系。'],['03','看到结果','将界面与对应结果并排组织，使用真实素材替换占位。']].map((a,i)=>`<button class="software-task ${i===0?'active':''}" data-software="${i}"><span class="eyebrow">${a[0]} / TASK</span><h3>${a[1]}</h3><p>${a[2]}</p></button>`).join('')}</div><button class="text-link" data-detail="other-software" style="margin-top:30px"><span>other / 其他软件入口</span><span>↗</span></button></div></section>`;}
function spacePage(){return routeHeader('Palmx Space','Palm X 的自有社区入口。继续发现、分享与讨论，不在官网里再造一套独立社区。')+`<section class="route-body"><div class="container"><div class="space-banner"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="自有社区入口的封面占位，非真实社区帖子"><div class="overlay"><span class="eyebrow">CREATE. SHARE. CONNECT.</span><h2>让灵感相遇，<br>让作品被看见。</h2><p>从一件作品开始，进入属于 Palm X 创作者的交流空间。</p><button class="primary" data-space-enter>进入 Palmx Space <span>↗</span></button></div><span class="asset-tag" style="left:auto;right:20px">社区封面 / 地址待接入</span></div><div class="section-head" style="margin-top:65px"><h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:32px">社区内容预览</h2><p>以下仅演示内容排版，不是已发布的社区内容，不显示虚构作者或互动数量。</p></div><div class="catalog-grid">${[['data:image/jpeg;base64,','每一件作品，都有一个开始。'],['data:image/jpeg;base64,','制作过程，值得分享。'],['data:image/jpeg;base64,','认识与你一样的创作者。']].map((a,i)=>`<button class="project-card" data-space-enter><div class="project-media" style="height:235px"><img src="${a[0]}" alt="社区内容预览占位"><span class="asset-tag">内容待接入</span></div><div class="project-body"><div class="meta"><span>COMMUNITY PREVIEW / 0${i+1}</span><span>↗</span></div><h3>${a[1]}</h3></div></button>`).join('')}</div><p class="catalog-note">本页只展示官网入口与预览版式。账号、登录、发帖、权限沿用真实社区，不在本稿中新增。</p></div></section>`;}
function communityPage(){return routeHeader('Community','我们的外部社交渠道，与 Palmx Space 自有社区分别呈现。')+`<section class="route-body"><div class="container"><div class="community-grid">${['Facebook Group','Reddit','LinkedIn','Discord'].map((n,i)=>`<button class="community-card" data-social="${n}"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">${['f','r','in','D'][i]}</span><h3>${n}</h3><p>查看 Palm X 在 ${n} 的官方渠道。</p><div class="status"><span>官方地址待配置 / 非平台 Logo 成稿</span><span>↗</span></div></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="section-note" style="margin-top:45px"><p>不伪造社群成员数量、帖子或讨论；未提供官方地址时不跳转到无关群组。</p><button class="text-link" data-route="space"><span>寻找自有社区？进入 Palmx Space</span><span>↗</span></button></div></div></section>`;}
function explorePage(){return routeHeader('Explore','从应用场景到知识资源，找到与你相关的内容。')+`<section class="route-body"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">APPLICATION</div><h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:36px">为不同的创造方式。</h2></div><p>保留四类应用场景，详情内容与实际案例待提供。</p></div><div class="scenario-grid">${scenarioCards()}</div><div style="border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:65px;padding-top:35px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;align-items:center"><div><div class="eyebrow">KNOWLEDGE</div><h2 style="font-size:36px;margin:10px 0">Wiki</h2><p class="muted">Coming soon · 知识内容正在准备。</p></div><button class="secondary" data-detail="wiki">查看状态 <span>↗</span></button></div></div></section>`;}
function supportPage(){return routeHeader('Support','品牌信息、联系支持与合作申请，清楚地放在你需要的位置。')+`<section class="route-body"><div class="container"><div class="support-grid">${[['about','About Us','品牌与研发故事的内容入口。'],['contact','Contact Us','联系团队，提交产品与合作问题。'],['news','News & Blog','品牌新闻与内容列表的展示位置。'],['affiliate','Affiliate','联盟合作的申请入口。'],['reseller','Become to reseller','经销合作的申请入口。']].map(a=>`<button class="support-card" data-detail="${a[0]}"><h3>${a[1]} <span style="float:right">↗</span></h3><p>${a[2]}</p></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="faq"><h2 style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:25px">服务信息</h2>${Object.entries(policy).map(([k,[t,p]])=>`<details><summary>${t}</summary><p>${p} 当前为原稿待确认条目，不是已生效承诺。</p></details>`).join('')}</div></div></section>`;}
const pageFns={products:productsPage,software:softwarePage,space:spacePage,community:communityPage,explore:explorePage,support:supportPage};
function navigate(name,options={}){closeMenu();if(!$('#reviewDialog').open){}else $('#reviewDialog').close();if(name==='home'){currentRoute='home';window.__pxRouteOpen=false;$('#route').hidden=true;$('#home').hidden=false;window.scrollTo({top:options.restore?homeY:0,behavior:'instant'});window.dispatchEvent(new Event('resize'));updateMaterials();return;}
 if(!pageFns[name])return;if(currentRoute==='home')homeY=scrollY;currentRoute=name;window.__pxRouteOpen=true;pauseMaterials();$('#home').hidden=true;$('#route').hidden=false;$('#route').innerHTML=pageFns[name]();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});requestAnimationFrame(()=>$('#route h1')?.focus({preventScroll:true}));}
function jump(id){if(currentRoute!=='home')navigate('home');closeMenu();$('#reviewDialog').open&&$('#reviewDialog').close();const el=$(id);if(el)el.scrollIntoView({behavior:reduced.matches?'instant':'smooth',block:'start'});}
function openDialog(title,content){closeMenu();pauseMaterials();dialogOpener=document.activeElement;$('#dialogTitle').textContent=title;$('#dialogContent').innerHTML=content;if(!$('#mainDialog').open)$('#mainDialog').showModal();$('#dialogClose').focus();}
function closeDialog(){const v=$('#dialogContent video');if(v)v.pause();$('#mainDialog').close();$('#dialogContent').innerHTML='';dialogOpener?.focus({preventScroll:true});updateMaterials();}
$('#dialogClose').onclick=closeDialog;$('#mainDialog').addEventListener('close',()=>{$('#dialogContent video')?.pause();updateMaterials();});
function openFilm(kind){const f=kind==='workspace'?{title:'屏幕 → 加工空间',src:'data:video/mp4;base64,